        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Square Pocket Door Lock with Thumbturns on Both Sides</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Privacy Square Tubular Pocket Door Set has a thumb turn on either side of the door and a 2-in-1 tubular latch with pop-out edge pull. The pop out edge pull is spring loaded and can be ejected from the door's edge with the press of a finger. This sliding door set will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch backsets. This Square Privacy Pocket Door Hardware is 2-1/2 inches x 2-1/2 inches with a modern styled privacy turn on both sides of the door that engage the latch.  Choose from one of the finish options including popular colors like oil rubbed bronze, black, and brass.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Privacy Function (bedroom or bathroom):</b> can be used on any pocket door that you may need to lock like a bedroom or bathroom door. Turning the thumbturn on either side of the door unlocks and locks the pocket door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Double Thumbturn Privacy Square Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Face Plate Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection off Door: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Height: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2135-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262400\"><b>Emtek 2135 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<I><b>Sold Individually *Approximately 2 Week Lead Time*</b></i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Double Thumbturn Square Pocket Door Lock",
                "description": "The Double Thumbturn Square Pocket Lock has an thumbturn on either side of the door for easy access. It will secure a pocket door that is 1-3/8 inches or 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch backset. For 2-1/8 inch bore hole preparation. The Square Pocket Door Lock with Thumbturns on Both Sides is available in a wide array of finishes.",
